For the YAML duplicate key loader:
```python
class StrictLoader(yaml.SafeLoader): pass
def _no_dup(loader, node, deep=False):
    mapping={}
    for k_node, v_node in node.value:
        k=loader.construct_object(k_node, deep=deep)
        if k in mapping: raise ValueError(f"duplicate key {k!r} at line {k_node.start_mark.line+1}")
        mapping[k]=loader.construct_object(v_node, deep=deep)
    return mapping
StrictLoader.add_constructor(yaml.resolver.BaseResolver.DEFAULT_MAPPING_TAG, _no_dup)
```
Careful: construct_object with deep for keys; standard approach.

For the F1 variant block extraction:
```python
def variant_block(text, class_id_marker='class_identity_variants:'):
    lines=text.splitlines()
    start=next(i for i,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('class_identity_variants:'))
    end=next(i for i in range(start+1,len(lines)) if lines[i] and not lines[i][0].isspace())
    return lines[start:end]
```
